@startuml
actor Student
boundary QuizInterface
control QuizController
control QuizManagementService
database Database
boundary NotificationService

Student -> QuizInterface: Access quizzes
QuizInterface -> QuizController: Request available quizzes
QuizController -> QuizManagementService: Fetch available quizzes
QuizManagementService -> Database: Retrieve quiz data
Database --> QuizManagementService: Return quiz data
QuizManagementService --> QuizController: Provide quiz data
QuizController --> QuizInterface: Display quizzes

alt Self-Assessment Quiz
    Student -> QuizInterface: Select self-assessment quiz
    QuizInterface -> QuizController: Request self-assessment quiz questions
    QuizController -> QuizManagementService: Fetch self-assessment quiz questions
    QuizManagementService -> Database: Retrieve questions
    Database --> QuizManagementService: Return questions
    QuizManagementService --> QuizController: Provide questions
    QuizController --> QuizInterface: Display questions
    
    Student -> QuizInterface: Submit self-assessment answers
    QuizInterface -> QuizController: Submit answers
    QuizController -> QuizManagementService: Process answers
    QuizManagementService -> Database: Store answers and calculate score
    Database --> QuizManagementService: Return calculation results
    QuizManagementService --> QuizController: Provide results
    QuizController --> QuizInterface: Display feedback and score
    
    QuizManagementService -> QuizManagementService: Update marking scheme
    QuizManagementService --> QuizController: Confirm self-assessment results integrated
    QuizController --> QuizInterface: Show integration confirmation
else Peer-Assessment Quiz
    Student -> QuizInterface: Select peer-assessment quiz
    QuizInterface -> QuizController: Request peer-assessment quiz questions
    QuizController -> QuizManagementService: Fetch peer-assessment quiz questions
    QuizManagementService -> Database: Retrieve questions
    Database --> QuizManagementService: Return questions
    QuizManagementService --> QuizController: Provide questions
    QuizController --> QuizInterface: Display questions
    
    Student -> QuizInterface: Submit peer-assessment answers
    QuizInterface -> QuizController: Submit answers
    QuizController -> QuizManagementService: Process answers
    QuizManagementService -> Database: Store answers and calculate score
    Database --> QuizManagementService: Return calculation results
    QuizManagementService --> QuizController: Provide results
    QuizController --> QuizInterface: Display feedback and score
    
    QuizManagementService -> QuizManagementService: Update marking scheme
    QuizManagementService --> QuizController: Confirm peer-assessment results integrated
    QuizController --> QuizInterface: Show integration confirmation
end

QuizManagementService -> NotificationService: Notify student of quiz availability and results
NotificationService -> Student: Send notifications

@enduml